<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFPC seeks 50,000 tonnes of corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFPC seeks 50,000 tonnes of corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feedgrain Purchase Committee (KFPC) on Thursday invited tenders to buy 50,000 tonnes of corn by 4:30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on Thursday, traders said.</p>
</text>
